WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Turn your to-do list into a plan for today. Beans is a daily planner.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.000
Spill the beans: put every task in the Brain Dump.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:18.567
Type a task into Quick Capture. It reads the date, label and time.

4
00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:26.833
Tasks with no date wait in the Brain Dump. Drag them onto a day.

5
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:30.667
Your whole week on one board.

6
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:36.767
The Timebox is your schedule. Drag a task onto it to block out time.

7
00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:40.100
Pull a block down to give it more time.

8
00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:44.067
Start the timer when you start the task.

9
00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:48.200
The timer keeps count while you work.

10
00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:51.067
Check it off and watch it sprout.

11
00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:53.400
The timer fills in how long it really took.

12
00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:57.467
Some tasks won't get done today.

13
00:00:57.567 --> 00:01:00.467
Anything unfinished moves to the next day at midnight.

14
00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:03.300
No guilt, no copying things over.

15
00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:07.767
Turn your to-do list into a plan for today. Start planning.
